<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>cut-and-sew</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/cut-and-sew.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/polos.css">
</head>

<body>
     <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-bg-container">
            <img src="../photos/cut-and-sew.webp" alt="Vito and Will folded polo shirts" class="hero-image">
        </div>

    </section>
    <section class="manufacturing-services">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Premium Cut and Sew Manufacturing Services</h2>

            <p class="section-text">
                The importance of cut and sew services in modern apparel manufacturing cannot be overstated. At Wuzwear
                Industry, we specialize in providing top-notch cut and sew manufacturing solutions, including
                <strong>pattern making, grading, prototyping, and sample production</strong>, all the way through to
                bulk manufacturing.
            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
                Our skilled tailors and technicians are equipped to handle medium to large production runs while
                maintaining outstanding precision and quality. With us, you can build your clothing line completely from
                scratch, backed by limitless customization options to ensure your brand stands out in today’s
                competitive fashion industry.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/cut-and-sew1.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Specialized Basic Patterns</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        Our facility provides clean, professional cut and sew services with pre-cut and custom fabric
                        patterns. Whether you need basic T-shirts, activewear, or other essentials, we can handle it
                        with ease.
                    </p>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        If you're searching for a <strong>T-shirt manufacturer with low MOQs</strong>, you're in the
                        right place. Not only do we guarantee high-quality products, but we also help you lower
                        production costs through our streamlined cut and sew process. It's a win-win solution for
                        startups and established brands alike.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row row-reverse">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/cut-and-sew2.webp" alt="Tailor working with denim fabric at a workbench">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Tailored Services for On-Demand Requirements</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        From <strong>custom T-shirts, swimsuits, tracksuits, and blankets to gym wear and
                            activewear</strong>, we can bring any concept to life. Simply share your design idea and
                        desired product, and our team will craft it with precision.
                    </p>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        We thrive on new challenges and innovative ideas, making us the perfect partner for brands
                        seeking <strong>fully customized cut and sew manufacturing solutions</strong>.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/cut-and-sew3.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Specialized Basic Patterns</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        Our facility provides clean, professional cut and sew services with pre-cut and custom fabric
                        patterns. Whether you need basic T-shirts, activewear, or other essentials, we can handle it
                        with ease.
                    </p>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        If you're searching for a <strong>T-shirt manufacturer with low MOQs</strong>, you're in the
                        right place. Not only do we guarantee high-quality products, but we also help you lower
                        production costs through our streamlined cut and sew process. It's a win-win solution for
                        startups and established brands alike.
                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>
    </section>
    <section class="faq-section">
        <div class="faq-container">
            <h2 class="faq-main-title">FAQS</h2>

            <div class="faq-accordion">
                <details class="faq-item" open>
                    <summary class="faq-trigger">
                        What is a cut and sew manufacturer?
                        <span class="faq-icon"></span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="faq-content">
                        <p>A cut and sew manufacturer produces apparel from scratch by cutting raw fabric and sewing it
                            into customized garments, instead of using pre-made blanks.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="faq-item">
                    <summary class="faq-trigger">
                        What is your Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)?
                        <span class="faq-icon"></span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="faq-content">
                        <p>Our Minimum Order Quantity varies depending on the specific design and customization
                            requirements. Please contact us for a detailed quote tailored to your needs.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="faq-item">
                    <summary class="faq-trigger">
                        What types of products can you cut and sew?
                        <span class="faq-icon"></span>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="faq-content">
                        <p>We can manufacture a wide range of items, including custom T-shirts, swimsuits, tracksuits,
                            blankets, gym wear, activewear, and fully customized complex patterns.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>


    <%- include('partials/popup') %>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>